"shall be calculated. Note that it has to be smaller than 'noe'. \"degrees of "
"differentiation\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/spatial_methods/spectral_volume.py:docstring
#: of
#: pybamm.spatial_methods.spectral_volume.SpectralVolume.chebyshev_differentiation_matrices:11
msgid ""
"The differentiation matrices in ascending order of differentiation order. "
"With exact arithmetic, the diff. matrix of order p would just be the pth "
"matrix power of the diff. matrix of order 1. This method computes the higher "
"orders in a more numerically stable way."
msgstr ""

