"\"Broadcasts\" the basic edge value reconstruction matrix to the actual "
"shape of the discretised symbols. Note that the product of this and a "
"discretised symbol is a vector which represents duplicate values for all "
"inner SV edges. These are the reconstructed values from both sides."
msgstr ""

